bash

# Put Option Scanner - Based on list of stocks, It finds the premium for specified DELTA (Which is also 0.10 Delta)
# Delta 0.10 means, Chance of Profite is 90%
# Works for Robinhood accounts.
# Need to provide login and password for your robin account.

====================================================================================
+ How to Install it:
    Download put_scanner.py package to your laptop or PC.
====================================================================================
+ How to run it on a linux Machine (This scripts run on windows as well)

    Command Syntax:
    python3 put_scanner.py -f <Stock Ticker File List> -d <Delta> -t <Date>

    Sample command:
    
    # Format 1 — your preferred style
    python3 put_scanner.py -f tickers.list -d 0.10 -t 15May2026
    
    # Format 2 — US date style
    python3 put_scanner.py -f tickers.list -d 0.10 -t 5/15/2026
    
    # Format 3 — ISO format
    python3 put_scanner.py -f tickers.list -d 0.10 -t 2026-05-15
    
    # No -t flag = automatically uses next Friday
    python3 put_scanner.py -f tickers.list -d 0.10
====================================================================================

Sample Stock Ticker List:

view tickers.list

