Buy% ==> This is a Percent Rating based on Stock Analyst. In Example above AMZN has 95.8% Buy Rating.
Annual% ==> For Premium specified in "Mark" column, what is Annual Rate of Return. In Exmaple above WULF has ROR of 46.22%
Weekly% ==> Weekly ROR, Weekly% * 52 = Annual%



